### Added

- **CameraTweaks · no camera clip**: Customizable third-person camera distance;
- **LegacyTweaks**: gather all the features related to restoring old-version visuals into this module;
- **LegacyTweaks · legacy music priority**: Automatically adjusts the priority of hub music after pack updating to prevent bgm duets;
- **LegacyTweaks · legacy moonglade marsh replay fix**: Only schedules the old Moonglade Marsh music for the resource pack [**Hypixel Skyblock Legacy**](https://github.com/nightlibra/hypixel_skyblock_legacy), fixing the issue of the background music playing muti-times in same time;
- **FancyDmgSplash · misc**: set damage numbers are hidden during dungeon clears and boss fights;

### Improved

- **Keybinds · commands keybind**: deleting a binding requires a second click to prevent misclicks;
- **MotionBlur**: pixels that barely move are no longer sampled, cutting the blur cost;
- **static rainbow/chroma**: you can customize the starting color of the text;
- **NickTweaks · nick changer**: color codes will display in their own color when typing;
- the project is relicensed to **LGPL-3.0**.

### Fixed

- switched to using `Objects.equals` for texture comparison to avoid unnecessary refreshes; by @FlyModeZ in https://github.com/raueyhs/Baity/pull/26
- **SmolPeople**: the third person front offset is no longer applied while swimming or crawling;
- **EnchantLore**: the rainbow preview renders even when the module is disabled;
- **InventoryTweaks · SidePanel**: adjusted the texture at the pixel level; the equipped column is no longer cleared when the worn set is not in the wardrobe;
- **InventoryTweaks · middle click**: replaced clicks no longer skip the container screen's click handling;
- **NickTweaks**: nicknames are no longer cut off, skipped after a colour code, or synced onto your own nametag;
- fixed a nametag submit scope leak and removed dead injections;
- text fields no longer keep capturing keys after clicking another control;
- SidePanel area detection was always empty, so Safari, Stillgore Chateau and dungeon checks work again;
- **SoftFullscreen**: tweaked how the features work with the game's fullscreen behavior.

